Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't solely my decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about whether it's okay\Nto put this out for the other students to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Dude, look at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Her tits are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Her tits are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's kept this a secret until now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's kept this a secret until now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Couldn't this stir up some ruckus amongst the students?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're in big trouble! Just look at the blackboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,50.4)}{\an7}Ririsa Amano-san! You're failing EVERY\N{\pos(409.6,100.8)}{\an7}SUBJECT! DETENTION TODAY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you failing everything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was totally focused on prepping for that event...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, Tachibana-san seems really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We should try to talk to her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:35.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,403.2)}{\an7}Five Rising Stars
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Amano?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-she's in detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?! Of all the days she had to be gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, I heard back about your club status.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I already know we're out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our report would've gotten\Nposted if we got approved,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:03:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and no one was freaking out about it today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So there's a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We got approved,\Nbut they're not gonna make the report public?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what they decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only the principal and the student council president\Nknow you guys are cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feeling torn?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess... But it's fine!\NWe should be happy we get to keep the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, is cosplay really something\Nwe need to keep a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the million-dollar question...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, it's more complicated than you think, Okumura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,They wrote this report knowing full\Nwell what the public reaction might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They said they shouldn't feel embarrassed about it,\Nor need to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I'm still not sure that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think they would've gone public like this\Nif they weren't about to lose their room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'd be better for them if they\Ndidn't have to go through that ordeal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:02.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But they knew that could happen,\Nand still decided to turn in their report as-is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That passion and determination convinced\Nme to sign on as their advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So would it be right for us to tell\Nthem they have to keep it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I don't think everyone will be\Nas accepting as they're hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have they considered those negative repercussions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think they just assumed it was\None of the risks of going public about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,As nice as it would be to allow\Ntheir decision to play out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,that's not a realistic course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're being too controlling.\NWe need to respect their decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're passionate and determined.\NAs an educator, that fills me with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder we'd leap at the\Nchance to support their passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:05:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, their fellow students may do just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some may tease them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Others could spread gossip\Nabout Amano-san online.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the worst case scenario,\Nthey could become the target of severe bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That reaction might convince her to\Ngive up her cosplay hobby altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,He really thinks our students are that cruel?\NOur own principal thinks they'd bully her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,This type of situation is hardly unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see, Hanyuu-sensei,\NI made a big mistake early in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was young and foolish,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and for decades afterwards,\NI blamed myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told myself I needed that failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ignored the pain and acted as if it was all justified.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But eventually, I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never needed to experience\Nthat failure to learn and grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:05:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could go back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd stop my younger self\Nfrom making that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't just watch him "gain experience,"\Nnot when I know how it affected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some people might think\Nmistakes make for good experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,we make mistakes\Nthat never help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,that we regret for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,As an adult who knows\Nthat regret all too well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want any child to\Nhave to experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If students never made mistakes,\Nthey wouldn't need their teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we truly want to show our students respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,then sometimes,\Nwe need to oppose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course, being older doesn't mean\Nwe'll always make the right decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But we should use our wealth of experience
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,to help guide them\Nalong the best possible path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,When push comes to shove,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:07:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,we need to keep them safe,\Neven if they hate us for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So he acknowledges our decision,\Nbut thinks going public is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not because he thinks what\Nyou're doing is shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's to keep you guys from getting hurt\Nby taking on more risk without knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we might've jumped to that decision\Nwithout thinking it through all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're more mature than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear what Ririsa thinks, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is now a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ran into her on my way here\Nand gave her the lowdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Amano-san said she's OK with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, and the student council president...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just did what our manual told us\Nto do and finished up the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did some research on cosplay as part of our review.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're free to do as you like,\Nbut we do have one rule you'll need to follow:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,you cannot possess or create\Npornographic or R-rated material.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,D-don't worry, we won't make anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And we won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Possess it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we'll throw out all the offending material today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, but it took you years to\Nbuild your collection, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should've known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,As club president,\NI'll do what's necessary for us to stay a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're not asking this because\Nwe don't like what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We just want to avoid any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're rooting for you, truly.\NKeep up the great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doing all that research got\Nme interested in cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see your costume sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our student council president is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,A saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should use the freed-up space on\Nthe bookshelf to erect a shrine in her honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otaku are so quick to pray to new gods...\NBut I'd do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, in any case, we get to stay a club!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai! I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great job, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait! I can feel your, your milky bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hug you?! Let your Sensei in on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NYou were Mayura-sama all this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get to cosplay at school,\Nand I have Mayura-sama as my teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never been this happy in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm dying of cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with the giant group hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:35.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with the giant group hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:36.17,Q4,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make room for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make room for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Old Castle! Joe versus Lustalotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,FIGHT!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, why are you so good at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been cosplaying Lustalotte forever.\NI've gotta be good at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our Milky Succubus Queen Mayura\Nis the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Milky" what? "Milky Mayura"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Milky Succubus Queen Mayura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lustalotte WINS!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, did you really have to beat me\Nwith a "touch of death" combo without looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:11.63,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,223.2)}{\an7}Milky Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So our new teacher is a legendary cosplayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's an actual miracle!\NI met her at an event ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:16.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,She was basically a god to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys should really stop casually throwing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,and now she's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,around the words "legendary" and "ages."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Especially when I'm not that much older than you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm 22! I just graduated college!\NI'm only five years older than you, Okumura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and a tenth-grader is\Nfive years older than a fifth-grader!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter when you're older!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see married couples who are 47 and 42!\NThat's normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Married couples?!\NSo you think it'd be totally normal to marry him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, would you ever marry a girl like our Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's rude to\Nask that right in front of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit stalling and answer the damn question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Well, lemme think...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We like the same stuff and\Ncan play video games together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're good at cooking and sewing too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, t-that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I getting so nervous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I his type, or not? Just tell me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she's 3D, and that's a red flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want me to sew your damn mouths shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:16.29,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,475.2)}{\an7}grump
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is happening right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of girl is your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, she's gotta have angel wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:17.75,Q7,,0,0,0,,She has blonde pigtails,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:19.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,She has blonde pigtails,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If what I heard is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,is cheerful and sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tachibana is Okumura's childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,and can use healing magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tachibana is Okumura's childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Poor girl's got it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were going to give me\Nsome sewing tips today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's exciting, huh, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your costumes are all so incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd commissioned them,\Nbut you made them yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Back in the day,\Nyou had to make your own cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're already a pretty skilled crafter, Amano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not at all!\NI'm totally self-taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anything you can teach me about\Ncrafting will be a huge help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's start with measuring yourself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's important to have\Nthe correct measurements
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you can make a pattern that fits your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get my clothes out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold it! Is she always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep, this is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll step out into the hall for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real.\NThen you and I can hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promised the student council\Nwe'd do things the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We went through all that to keep our room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get it taken away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura really is so mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's so great...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-those are her legendary milky bits...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're up against the\Nproportions of the manga character.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're never gonna\Nmatch their proportions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so your real measurements don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Use pads and shapewear to increase your bust,\Nor binders to flatten it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but be sure you're wearing them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:46.42,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'd say both of you match their proportions already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but be sure you're wearing them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.25,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'd say both of you match their proportions already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,when you take your measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:47.79,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'd say both of you match their proportions already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once you've got your numbers,\Nlook at your references and start thinking fabrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What materials have you been using,\Nand where do you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've mostly been using stretch PVC and faux leather,\Nsometimes poly twill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get most of my fabric from Yuzawaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys have it so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.71,0:13:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Back in the dark ages,\Nyou had to go to Nippori to get any specialty fabrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll go there when I need to, but yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today we have all the colors we need for any cosplay,\Nbut it was way more limited back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:22.04,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,115.2)}{\an7}Goodbye,\N{\pos(371.2,165.6)}{\an7}hair cuticle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay wigs weren't much of a thing yet,\Nso some people dyed their actual hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:26.79,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,129.6)}{\an7}BEFORE:                                                             NOW:\N{\pos(128,237.6)}{\an7}I mixed 100-yen clear mascara with\N{\pos(128,388.8)}{\an7}eyeshadow to make my own color!!\N{\pos(102.4,446.4)}{\an7}It matches my wig\N{\pos(819.2,496.8)}{\an7}So many colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:26.79,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,547.2)}{\an7}Thank god for affordable, vivid makeup!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makeup was expensive and limited in scope,\Nso some people made their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:27.88,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,129.6)}{\an7}BEFORE:\N{\pos(128,237.6)}{\an7}I mixed 100-yen clear mascara with\N{\pos(128,388.8)}{\an7}eyeshadow to make my own color!!\N{\pos(102.4,453.6)}{\an7}It matches my wig
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You couldn't get prescription color contacts,\Nso we couldn't look right at the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:32.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,72)}{\an7}BEFORE\N{\pos(140.8,338.4)}{\an7}Is he taking\N{\pos(140.8,388.8)}{\an7}my picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.21,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,57.6)}{\an7}Glasses fetish heaven!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why you saw so many cosplayers wearing glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And color contacts were expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,so some people chose their\Ncosplays based on what they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And there weren't online marketplaces,\Nso we'd go to bulletin boards to trade costume parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:46.13,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,93.6)}{\an7}Manager\N{\pos(371.2,273.6)}{\an7}Upper management\N{\pos(345.6,324)}{\an7}says it's probably a no-go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bulletin boards?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not like the ones in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We kept in touch over IM. Calling cost money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:54.67,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,295.2)}{\an7}Gotcha, I'll talk to to them myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's IM?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:14:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things were way tougher back then,\Nbut we all found a way to get our cosplays done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about patterning a costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:07.08,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,216)}{\an7}Club Trash
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're throwing out your collection after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Yeah, I said we would.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're taking your job so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,So there really are people out\Nthere who'll cry about porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and laugh.\NI'm just another weird otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules, but I do feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you can buy them again when you turn eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about these things, but, uh,\Nonce you're of age,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's completely okay for\Nyou to possess adult material.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Prez...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-was I wrong or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doujinshi only get printed once in small supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to get these ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.17,Q4,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to get these ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.21,Q15,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I'll pray, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, are you guys cosplaying today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, probably not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.67,0:15:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you have any interest in-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll come by now and then to make\Nsure you're still doing a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you say something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-nope, didn't say a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, my lord!\NOur darling Liliel is the talk of the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really? I was too nervous to look it up myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you're missing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the legendary Mr. Camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is he a famous photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:16:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's not just any photographer.\NHe's Mr. Camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, and what does that mean?\NSounds freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,People say that any cosplayer he\Nhighlights is bound to become a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's a legendary figure in the cosplay world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that makes him sound like some creepy producer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, he's just a regular office worker,\Nand a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's been taking pictures of amateur\Ncosplayers for over twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so he's got an impeccable eye for talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He photographed the Heavenly Queens\Nback when they were no-name cosplayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell, he's the one who coined the\NFour Heavenly Queens in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,As such, his website, Mr. Camera's Cosplay Blog,\Nhas quite the influence on the cosplay world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So he gave himself that weird name.\NKeep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Last night, he posted a new photo article,\Nwith this shocking title:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Make Way for the Five Rising Stars of Cosplay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Five Rising Stars of Cosplay?!\NYou sure this guy isn't full of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna turn into Swordmaster Yamato, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it did, then you would be one of\Nthe warriors being struck down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your darling Liliel is on this illustrious list!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:21.38,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,388.8)}{\an7}With the concept of Rising Star!\N{\pos(256,439.2)}{\an7}Liliel reaches fifth place
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The list names cosplayers who came\Nonto the scene within the last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sadly, this means Milady Magino was ineligible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,These Five Rising Stars were\Nranked from top to bottom as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He ranked them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-where's Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Number five! Impressive, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Number five? That's dead last...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, but just being mentioned in a\NMr. Camera article is incredible, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,He wrote:\NNumber Five, Liliel (name unknown).
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,At Yokosuka CosStream,\Nshe drew a crowd rivaling Miss 753.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her costume and poses are impeccable,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:01.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you can tell she harbors\Na deep love for the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her choice of character and approach to\Ncosplay is reminiscent of Mayura-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder many have said she is\Nnext in line for the Heavenly throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, this is her second appearance as Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Continuing with her could prove boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And with how skilled she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,there appears to be little\Nroom for her to grow and improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Considering this potential stagnation,\NI've placed her as number five on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if she keeps this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,she could forge carve out a niche,\Njust like Mayura-chan did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think he's full of shit!\NMy Liliel is the cutest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, my lord, this is an unbiased review!\NPray, take it as earnest critique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.08,Q16,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,172.8)}{\an7}HMMMMM
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But something doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ranking,\Nsaying she's got no room to grow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I'd be pretty happy if\Nhe'd put her as number one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just salty she didn't rank higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, he's got a lot more to say about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so take a look at it when\Nyou've cleared your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And so you know, my lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,he only posted about\NNumber Five and Number Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear about his Number Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember this girl well.\NShe caused quite the stir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:23.17,Q17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,295.2)}{\an7}School Idol Series Cosplay Event\N{\pos(755.2,345.6)}{\an7}School Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.54,0:19:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She cosplayed Coulia from the\Nphone game Cinderella Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her completely unwavering stoic expression\Nembodied the soul of her icy character!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As for the reason this rising star\Ncaused that aforementioned stir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, from the moment she arrived\Nto the moment she disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,she said not a single word,\Nnor did she move a single muscle on her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No hellos, no calling card...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,just an icy princess that some\Nmight have taken as haughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet her single appearance has sent
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.67,Q18,,0,0,0,,Holy hell, she's the perfect Coulia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.67,Q19,,0,0,0,,Yet her single appearance has sent
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:00.54,Q18,,0,0,0,,Now this is cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:00.54,Q19,,0,0,0,,ripples across the entire cosplay community!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rising Star Number Four, the icy beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,NONOA!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen a fresh-faced cosplayer\Nmake such an impact at their first event.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say she surpasses our fair Liliel,\Nbut I understand why he placed her fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,In either case,\Nfor Liliel to only be fifth on this list of rising stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It truly speaks to the breadth\Nof talent in the cosplay scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.67,0:20:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I daresay this year's Summer Comiket\Nwill be a sight to behold...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fifth?! Ohmigosh, I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone wrote about me!\NI hope my pictures look okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you make of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, this girl in fourth is super cute!\NWhat an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That she's... Ranked higher than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would I be upset?\NI mean, read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They could see how much I love Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't know they wrote that.\NI hadn't gotten that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoever this is, they totally saw what I was doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.17,0:21:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone gets me!\NThat's totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being ranked fifth is just icing on the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though I wish everyone also\Nthought she's the cutest Liliel ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right.\NCosplay's not a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what I learned at our last event.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers all share the same love!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Speaking of events,\Nlet's start planning for the next one, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fifth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could get her to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:24:00.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,388.8)}{\an7}Can We Be Friends?
